  "details": "I just had both me and 4 other people randomly get kicked to their home world with the message \"more than half of the instance has voted you out\" or something like that, and whenever any of us try to re-connect we get the message \"you have been kicked from this world for an hour\", this sounds like a normal vote kick, until you consider the fact nobody started the vote, nobody accepted anything, we just keep getting kicked randomly, we've had to make 4 seperate new instances because of this bug, and each time we keep getting kicked, even if we are the instance owner, there is no possible way we are being voted out of our own instances when we re-invite our friends, everyone who we re-invite each time says they never even got a notification of any vote kick being started...\nAttached image: what happens when I try to re-join (this is why we've had to make 4 seperate instances and move to them, it's been happening to more than just me by the way, two of my friends have been affected by this issue and have had to have new instances made because of it)",
